  "text": "求解以下微分方程的通解：\n\n(a) $\\frac{dy}{dx}=y^2-4$\n\n(b) $\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}+\\left(\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right)^2=0$",
  "knowledge_points": [
