    "化简答案"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "ode_separable",
    "template": "可分离型与二阶降阶型微分方程",
    "variable_count": 2
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "(a) 分离变量法求解",
      "steps": [
        "方程 $\\frac{dy}{dx}=y^2-4$ 是可分离变量的微分方程",
        "分离变量：$\\frac{dy}{y^2-4}=dx$",
        "对左边进行部分分式分解：$y^2-4=(y-2)(y+2)$",
        "$\\frac{1}{y^2-4}=\\frac{1}{(y-2)(y+2)}=\\frac{A}{y-2}+\\frac{B}{y+2}$",
        "展开：$1=A(y+2)+B(y-2)$",
        "取 $y=2$：$1=4A \\Rightarrow A=\\frac{1}{4}$",
        "取 $y=-2$：$1=-4B \\Rightarrow B=-\\frac{1}{4}$",
        "所以 $\\frac{1}{y^2-4}=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\frac{1}{y-2}-\\frac{1}{y+2}\\right)$",
        "两边积分：$\\int\\frac{dy}{y^2-4}=\\int dx$",
        "$\\frac{1}{4}[\\ln|y-2|-\\ln|y+2|]=x+C_1$",
        "$\\frac{1}{4}\\ln\\left|\\frac{y-2}{y+2}\\right|=x+C_1$",
        "$\\ln\\left|\\frac{y-2}{y+2}\\right|=4x+4C_1=4x+C$（记 $C=4C_1$）",
        "$\\left|\\frac{y-2}{y+2}\\right|=e^{4x+C}=Ke^{4x}$（记 $K=e^C$）",
        "$\\frac{y-2}{y+2}=Ae^{4x}$（记 $A=\\pm K$，为任意常数）",
        "解出 $y$：$y-2=Ae^{4x}(y+2)$",
        "$y-Ae^{4x}y=2+2Ae^{4x}$",
        "$y(1-Ae^{4x})=2(1+Ae^{4x})$",
        "**通解**：$y=\\frac{2(1+Ae^{4x})}{1-Ae^{4x}}$，其中 $A$ 为任意常数"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "(b) 降阶法求解",
      "steps": [
        "方程 $\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}+\\left(\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right)^2=0$ 是二阶方程，不显含 $y$",
        "令 $p=\\frac{dy}{dx}$，则 $\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=\\frac{dp}{dx}=\\frac{dp}{dy}\\cdot\\frac{dy}{dx}=p\\frac{dp}{dy}$",
        "代入方程：$p\\frac{dp}{dy}+p^2=0$",
        "$p\\left(\\frac{dp}{dy}+p\\right)=0$",
        "**情况1**：$p=0$，即 $\\frac{dy}{dx}=0$",
        "  解得 $y=C_1$（常数解）",
        "**情况2**：$\\frac{dp}{dy}+p=0$，即 $\\frac{dp}{dy}=-p$",
        "  分离变量：$\\frac{dp}{p}=-dy$",
        "  积分：$\\ln|p|=-y+C_2$",
        "  得 $p=Ae^{-y}$（记 $A=\\pm e^{C_2}$）",
        "  即 $\\frac{dy}{dx}=Ae^{-y}$",
        "  分离变量：$\\frac{dy}{Ae^{-y}}=dx$",
        "  $e^y dy = A dx$",
        "  积分：$e^y = Ax + B$",
        "  得 $y=\\ln|Ax+B|$",
        "**通解**：$y=\\ln|Ax+B|$，其中 $A, B$ 为任意常数（包含常数解 $y=C_1$ 作为特例）"
      ]
    }
  ],
