      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "Logistic方程求解",
          "steps": [
            "分离变量：$\\frac{dy}{y(1-y)}=dx$",
            "部分分式分解：$\\frac{1}{y(1-y)}=\\frac{1}{y}+\\frac{1}{1-y}$",
            "积分：$\\int\\left(\\frac{1}{y}+\\frac{1}{1-y}\\right)dy=\\int dx$",
            "$\\ln|y|-\\ln|1-y|=x+C_1$",
            "$\\ln\\left|\\frac{y}{1-y}\\right|=x+C_1$",
            "$\\frac{y}{1-y}=Ae^x$",
            "解出 $y$：$y=Ae^x(1-y) \\Rightarrow y(1+Ae^x)=Ae^x$",
            "**通解**：$y=\\frac{Ae^x}{1+Ae^x}=\\frac{1}{1+Be^{-x}}$（其中 $B=A^{-1}$）"
          ]
        }
      ],
